"You" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights under this
License.

"Internal Use" means use of the Software solely for Your own internal business,
operational, development, testing, security, connectivity, automation, or
administrative purposes, without providing the Software or its functionality to
third parties as a product or service.

"Customer-Owned Deployment" means installation or operation of the Software in
an environment owned, leased, or directly controlled by a customer, where the
customer is the direct user of the Software and the Software is not offered by
You as a hosted, shared, managed, or multi-tenant service.

"Productization" means using the Software, its source code, a substantial
portion of it, or a derivative work to create, manufacture, distribute,
license, sell, offer, market, or operate a commercial software product,
appliance, hosted service, or managed service that incorporates, derives from,
substantially reproduces, exposes, or provides the functionality of the
Software.

"Competitive Product or Service" means a product or service that competes with,
substitutes for, or offers substantially similar functionality to Data Relay
Link, including a product or service whose primary purpose includes secure
remote access, controlled network egress, relay-based private-network access,
MCP/AI access to private endpoints, or substantially similar secure
connectivity functionality in a manner that can reasonably substitute for the
Software.

"Managed Service" includes SaaS, MSP, hosted, shared-service, multi-tenant, or
service-provider offerings in which a third party receives access to, or the
primary benefit of, the Software's functionality.

